{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/672","id":4729135608,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGeDh-A","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/672","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/672.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/672","number":672,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(trials): coach trial setting, client trial offer, trial-ending notice (split T2 of #656)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Tier:** T4 (money path). **Why:** free trials with a card up front: the one-trial ledger decides who gets a trial and the trial-ending notice states what the card will be charged. **T4 trigger scan:** money (Stripe trial subscriptions, charge copy), privacy (notice and ledger logs carry ids and closed codes only), outbound provider calls (fix round 8: abortable push/email, Resend Idempotency-Key). **T3 trigger scan:** schema + migrations (T1), cron worker and outbound push/email (T2), Stripe webhooks (T3). **Bounded T1:** none. **Canonical builder:** agent 115 (split of #656); fix round 6 by B-T12-116 (agent 116); fix round 7 by B-TR-117 (agent 117); fix round 8 by B-TR2-117 (agent 117); fix round 9 by B-TR3-118 (agent 118). **Parent owner:** #656. **Acceptance evidence:** Fix round table below (failing-before and passing-after CI lane runs). **Promotion triggers:** none (already T4).\n\n**Fix round table**\n\n| Round | Piece head | Findings closed | Failing-before | Passing-after |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 6 (B-T12-116) | `4fa2fe4a` | Sol B-672-1, B-672-2; Opus B-672-1, C-672-1..5, C-672-6 (comment); merges T1 `1efac91e` | [run 37174499909](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37174499909) | [run 37174803961](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37174803961) |\n| 7 (B-TR-117) | `6ce54002` | #675 x T2 packages.controller/service overlap resolved keeping both (idempotent create + trial_days); composed-behaviour spec `test/b-trials-t2-idempotent-create-http.spec.ts`; merges T1 `c75002c9` | [run 37179924220](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37179924220) (T2 only, 6 fail), [run 37179934691](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37179934691) (main controller, 8 fail) | [run 37179946404](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37179946404) (247/247 + tsc) |\n| 8 (B-TR2-117) | `c5e7ed8e` | Sol B-672-3, B-672-4; Opus C-672-7 (ruling: time + zone unless the client's own zone), C-672-8, C-672-9 ([FIX ROUND 8](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/672#issuecomment-5977736892)) | [run 37185289635](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185289635) (16 fail) | [run 37185318643](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185318643) (133/133 + tsc, incl. Sol's probe file) |\n| 9 (B-TR3-118) | `2690c07c` | Sol B-672-3 (narrowed): each channel's copy is built at admission (after the claim and the preference read) from the purchase read last; tests in T3 under the size cap ([FIX ROUND 9](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/672#issuecomment-5982762148)) | [run 37221109080](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221109080) (T3 df76889f, 7 B-672-3 tests red) | [run 37221167230](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221167230) (93/93 + tsc); probes [run 37221205916](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221205916) |\n\nSplit of #656 (free trials, backend) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). #656 was 5,611 lines at `86223987` (FIX ROUND 5). Stack: T1 -> T2 -> T3, merged back to back; deploy only after T3, together with mobile #338. Owner adds the Stripe webhook event `customer.subscription.trial_will_end` before that deploy. The tree at T3 equalled #656 @ 86223987 (checked with git diff) until fix round 6, which adds the T1/T2 fixes. Prior verdicts on #656 (Sol RC 0/4/1 at b9939d02; no full Opus audit) do not carry; each piece needs fresh Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece.\n\n**T2 (base T1, 2,961 lines after fix round 9; 2,977 after fix round 8; 2,371 after fix round 7; 1,954 after fix round 6). SIZE ASSESSMENT (over 1,500): one reviewable unit (package trial editor + notice worker with its push/email transports); under the 3,000 hard limit.** package create/update accept trial_days under the trial rules; client package list and detail carry trial_offer for that client; TrialUsageService, TrialNoticeService and TrialCheckoutCapability registered and exported by PackagesModule; trial-ending email template and notification kind; package-rules spec and the restored one-trial-rule assertion (43/43 pass locally across the two specs). Not deployable alone: checkout does not honour a trial until T3.\n\n**#675 composition (fix round 7):** coach M2 #675 (idempotent package create) merged into main first, so this piece carries both behaviours: `trial_days` is stored by #675's `createData` on both create paths, the trial rules run in `assertValidPricing` before an Idempotency-Key is claimed, and #675's fingerprint drops `trial_days` at 0 so keys claimed before the trials deploy still replay. Pinned over HTTP by `test/b-trials-t2-idempotent-create-http.spec.ts`.\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T19:31:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T17:53:21Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"25cb99331580b5d3b24d0e03ce714406f82d9580","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/672/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/672/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/672/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-